   "type": "DiffNote",
   "body": "I explained the finding in two sentences above, and made no changes or tool calls beyond recording my intent.\n\nThe short version: the missing capacity check lets `remainingSeats` go negative instead of rejecting the enrollment, and that corrupted count then misleads every later enrollment that reads it.\n\n<!-- kody-codereview -->\n<!-- kody-conversation -->",
